{"id":"9c83eb4d825176c2","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-graph-degree-function.md","title":"ZFC Graph Degree Function","display":"df-zfc-graph-degree-function — ZFC Graph Degree Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-graph-degree-function","aliases":["58-df-zfc-graph-degree-function"],"display":"df-zfc-graph-degree-function — ZFC Graph Degree Function","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-graph.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-successor-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-graph-degree-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-graph-degree-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-graph-degree-function — ZFC Graph Degree Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0dc79ccc1050ee64\" href=\"?note=0dc79ccc1050ee64\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-graph.md\">../batch03/58-df-graph.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b2079cb7dec7ca43\" href=\"?note=b2079cb7dec7ca43\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-zfc-successor-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-zfc-successor-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\deg_G,G,W,E,v\\in V\">\\(\\deg_G,G,W,E,v\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Graph}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Graph}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Degree}_S:V^2\\rightharpoonup V\">\\(\\operatorname{Degree}_S:V^2\\rightharpoonup V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0dc79ccc1050ee64\" href=\"?note=0dc79ccc1050ee64\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-graph.md\">../batch03/58-df-graph.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGraphDegreeFunction}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGraphDegreeFunction}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\\in V\">\\(\\lambda\\in V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> 使用上述内部依赖。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}degree\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGraphDegreeFunction}_S(\\deg_G,G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists W,E,\\lambda\\in V\\;\\Bigl(G=\\langle W,E\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Graph}_S(G)\n\\land\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\lambda,|W|)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\deg_G,W,\\lambda\\cup\\{\\lambda\\})\n\\land\\forall v\\in W\\;(\\deg_G(v)=\\operatorname{Degree}_S(v,G))\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}degree\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGraphDegreeFunction}_S(\\deg_G,G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists W,E,\\lambda\\in V\\;\\Bigl(G=\\langle W,E\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Graph}_S(G)\n\\land\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\lambda,|W|)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\deg_G,W,\\lambda\\cup\\{\\lambda\\})\n\\land\\forall v\\in W\\;(\\deg_G(v)=\\operatorname{Degree}_S(v,G))\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Degrees of infinite graphs need not be natural numbers; the successor-cardinal bound is a set containing every possible degree of a vertex in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-graph.md","status":"resolved","id":"0dc79ccc1050ee64","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-graph.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-zfc-successor-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"b2079cb7dec7ca43","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-successor-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-graph.md","status":"resolved","id":"0dc79ccc1050ee64","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Graph}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ and $\\operatorname{Degree}_S:V^2\\rightharpoonup V$ (see [[../batch03/58-df-graph.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\deg_G,G,W,E,v\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Graph}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Degree}_S:V^2\\rightharpoonup V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcGraphDegreeFunction}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}degree\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGraphDegreeFunction}_S(\\deg_G,G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists W,E,\\lambda\\in V\\;\\Bigl(G=\\langle W,E\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Graph}_S(G)\n\\land\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\lambda,|W|)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\deg_G,W,\\lambda\\cup\\{\\lambda\\})\n\\land\\forall v\\in W\\;(\\deg_G(v)=\\operatorname{Degree}_S(v,G))\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"W","display":false}],"bytes":1354,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2239","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-graph-degree-function.md|58-df-zfc-graph-degree-function]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","0dc79ccc1050ee64","b2079cb7dec7ca43","36d7463d215be751"]}